        "name": "Team Navigation and Drill-Down Guide",
        "description": "",
        "theme": "newSolidDarkBlue",
        "interval": 3,
        "type": "text",
        "timescale": "day",
        "version": 2,
        "content": "<section class=\"psc-nav-guide\"><style>\n.psc-nav-guide {\n  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827 0%, #172554 100%);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 18px 20px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.psc-nav-guide h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n.psc-nav-guide p {\n  margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  color: #dbeafe;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.psc-nav-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.psc-nav-card {\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .72);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, .20);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 13px;\n  min-height: 110px;\n}\n.psc-nav-card h3 {\n  margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n.psc-nav-card ul {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-left: 16px;\n  color: #cbd5e1;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n.psc-nav-pill {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 5px 8px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: rgba(96, 165, 250, .18);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, .24);\n  color: #bfdbfe;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 1000px) { .psc-nav-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }\n@media (max-width: 700px) { .psc-nav-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n</style>\n<h2>Team Navigation Guide</h2>\n<p>Use this section when presenting or handing off the dashboard. The executive page should remain summary-focused. Use detailed dashboards for investigation so this view stays clean and decision-oriented.</p>\n<div class=\"psc-nav-grid\">\n  <div class=\"psc-nav-card\">\n    <span class=\"psc-nav-pill\">Executive View</span>\n    <h3>What leaders should review</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Regional health</li>\n      <li>Geographic impact</li>\n      <li>Active exceptions</li>\n      <li>Acquisition risk</li>\n      <li>Capacity trend signals</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"psc-nav-card\">\n    <span class=\"psc-nav-pill\">Operations Drill-Down</span>\n    <h3>Where engineers go next</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>West Region Detail</li>\n      <li>North Region Detail</li>\n      <li>East Region Detail</li>\n      <li>Southwest / Great Midwest / Southeast Detail</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"psc-nav-card\">\n    <span class=\"psc-nav-pill\">Program Review</span>\n    <h3>Special program follow-up</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Acquisition Detail</li>\n      <li>Allina Health / Polaris</li>\n      <li>Ohio Health / Dexter</li>\n      <li>UH Cleveland / Karsner</li>\n      <li>Corewell / Pepper</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"psc-nav-card\">\n    <span class=\"psc-nav-pill\">Decision Rule</span>\n    <h3>When to escalate</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Critical alert with business impact</li>\n      <li>Multiple regions degraded</li>\n      <li>Capacity trend approaching threshold</li>\n      <li>Unowned or stale ticket</li>\n      <li>Recurring acquisition-site exception</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</section>"
      }
    }
